																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"702157662356244406","clan_steamid":"103582791475771053","event_name":"The Gift Shop Update","event_type":14,"appid":5027520,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793378760,"rtime32_end_time":1793383201,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Our fifth official map is here, with 350+ new products, seasonal areas, and our biggest discount yet!\",\"Unsere f\u00fcnfte offizielle Karte ist da \u2013 mit \u00fcber 350 neuen Produkten, saisonalen Bereichen und unserem gr\u00f6\u00dften Rabatt!\",\"Notre 5e carte officielle est l\u00e0 : plus de 350 nouveaux produits, des espaces saisonniers et notre plus grosse promo !\",null,null,null,\"\u7b2c\u4e94\u5f20\u5b98\u65b9\u5730\u56fe\u6b63\u5f0f\u4e0a\u7ebf\uff01\u5e26\u6765350\u591a\u79cd\u5168\u65b0\u5546\u54c1\u3001\u8282\u65e5\u4e3b\u9898\u533a\u57df\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u6211\u4eec\u8fc4\u4eca\u4e3a\u6b62\u529b\u5ea6\u6700\u5927\u7684\u6298\u6263\uff01\",null,null,null,\"5\u3064\u76ee\u306e\u516c\u5f0f\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u304c\u767b\u5834\uff01350\u7a2e\u985e\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306e\u65b0\u5546\u54c1\u3084\u5b63\u7bc0\u9650\u5b9a\u30a8\u30ea\u30a2\u3001\u904e\u53bb\u6700\u5927\u306e\u30bb\u30fc\u30eb\u3082\uff01\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Be\u015finci resm\u00ee haritam\u0131z geldi! 350'den fazla yeni \u00fcr\u00fcn, mevsimlik b\u00f6l\u00fcmler ve bug\u00fcne kadarki en b\u00fcy\u00fck indirimimiz!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Explore the new Gift Store with 4,696 items, 324 shelves, 5 hidden Arcade Tokens, and Christmas and Halloween corners. Plus, the Level Editor will be coming soon\",\"Entdecke den neuen Geschenkeladen mit 4.696 Artikeln, 324 Regalen, 5 versteckten Arcade-Tokens sowie Weihnachts- und Halloween-Bereichen. Der Level-Editor kommt bald!\",\"D\u00e9couvrez la boutique de cadeaux : 4 696 objets \u00e0 ranger, 324 \u00e9tag\u00e8res, 5 jetons d'arcade cach\u00e9s, des espaces No\u00ebl et Halloween. L'\u00e9diteur de niveaux arrive bient\u00f4t !\",null,null,null,\"\u63a2\u7d22\u5168\u65b0\u793c\u54c1\u5e97\uff01\u5305\u542b4,696\u4ef6\u5f85\u6574\u7406\u5546\u54c1\u3001324\u4e2a\u8d27\u67b6\u30015\u679a\u9690\u85cf\u7684\u8857\u673a\u4ee3\u5e01\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u5723\u8bde\u8282\u548c\u4e07\u5723\u8282\u4e3b\u9898\u533a\u57df\u3002\u5173\u5361\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u4e5f\u5373\u5c06\u63a8\u51fa\uff01\",null,null,null,\"\u65b0\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u300c\u30ae\u30d5\u30c8\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30d7\u300d\u3092\u63a2\u7d22\uff014,696\u500b\u306e\u5546\u54c1\u3001324\u53f0\u306e\u68da\u3001\u96a0\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30c8\u30fc\u30af\u30f35\u679a\u3001\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30de\u30b9\u3068\u30cf\u30ed\u30a6\u30a3\u30f3\u306e\u30a8\u30ea\u30a2\u304c\u767b\u5834\u3002\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30a8\u30c7\u30a3\u30bf\u30fc\u3082\u8fd1\u65e5\u516c\u958b\u4e88\u5b9a\uff01\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Yeni Hediyelik E\u015fya Ma\u011fazas\u0131'n\u0131 ke\u015ffedin! 4.696 \u00fcr\u00fcn, 324 raf, 5 gizli Arcade Jetonu, Noel ve Cad\u0131lar Bayram\u0131 k\u00f6\u015feleri sizi bekliyor. Seviye Edit\u00f6r\u00fc de yak\u0131nda!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"3f814e6fcc492aed453eb496ba2c7f1d2cfb6fc7.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"f6eb221c9dc28ebe07292211f35b8f5c40c42447.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"702157662356244407","clanid":"46249645","posterid":"0","headline":"The Gift Shop Update","posttime":1793378790,"updatetime":1793378790,"body":"[h1]Surprise Update: The Gift Shop Is Here![\/h1][p][\/p][p]Hello everyone![\/p][p]We know many of you have been waiting for the [b]Level Editor update[\/b], but we have a surprise for you first![\/p][p]This update introduces the [b]fifth and final planned official map[\/b] for Megastore: Tidy Up Together, the [b]Gift Store![\/b][\/p][p]Before releasing the Level Editor, we wanted to make sure that all of our unique products would be available for you to use in your own creations from day one. And with Halloween still here, we thought this would be the perfect opportunity to surprise you with a brand-new map featuring both Halloween and Christmas items![\/p][p][\/p][h2][b]\ud83c\udf89 Our Biggest Discount Yet![\/b][\/h2][p]To celebrate the completion of all five official maps, we're also launching [b]our first custom discount and our biggest discount yet![\/b][\/p][p]If you haven't picked up Megastore: Tidy Up Together yet, now is a great time to jump in! With all five official maps available and the Level Editor getting closer, there's more content to enjoy than ever before.[\/p][p]We're also aiming to launch the [b]public Level Editor before the discount ends![\/b][\/p][p]The editor has already been undergoing closed playtesting for over a week, and we've received some fantastic feedback so far. We're working hard to polish the experience and make creating your own stores as smooth and intuitive as possible.[\/p][p]But first, let's take a look at our newest map![\/p][p][\/p][h2][b]\ud83c\udf81 Welcome to the Gift Store![\/b][\/h2][p]For this map, we wanted to create something with its own unique character.[\/p][p]The Gift Store takes place in a modern-day boutique with [b]art gallery-inspired architecture[\/b], a two-story layout with an overlooking balcony, and a mixture of vintage, retro, and Victorian-inspired details.[\/p][p]We focused on creating a warm, cozy atmosphere with carefully placed lighting, a nighttime setting, and a beautiful night sky visible through the glass dome.[\/p][p]The result is a store that feels quite different from our previous maps, while still maintaining the cozy atmosphere of Megastore: Tidy Up Together.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/43148e51c219784f72e87cfd146a5d6554321d57.gif\"][\/img][\/p][h2][b]\ud83d\udcda Over 350 Brand-New Products![\/b][\/h2][p]Every single product in the Gift Store is new! None of them have appeared in our previous maps.[\/p][p]With [b]over 350 new unique products[\/b], the total number of unique models across the game has now surpassed [b]1,700![\/b][\/p][p]You'll find a wide variety of items, including books, clocks, ceramic decorations, collectibles, gifts, and plenty of seasonal products.[\/p][p]The store is organized into distinct areas, each with its own atmosphere, decorations, and carefully arranged product categories.[\/p][h3]\ud83c\udf84 A Cozy Christmas Corner[\/h3][p]Our Christmas section brings a festive atmosphere to the store, featuring holiday decorations, a special Santa Claus corner, beautifully decorated Christmas trees, and a collection of seasonal gifts and ornaments.[\/p][p]We wanted this area to feel warm and inviting, with its own little holiday charm.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/126c105360a5ab7b6bbdcfcf20e3c75d16e0c155.gif\"][\/img][\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udf83 A Little Halloween Magic[\/b][\/h3][p]On the other side of the store, you'll discover our dedicated Halloween section![\/p][p]Filled with pumpkins, skeletons, themed decorations, and all kinds of Halloween-inspired products, this area offers a completely different atmosphere while still fitting into the cozy character of the Gift Store.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/fcbcd23cc04374ab98ea22c3ef6494155bb64559.gif\"][\/img][\/p][h3][b]\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Explore the Second Floor![\/b][\/h3][p]One of our favorite features of this map is its [b]two-story layout with an overlooking balcony[\/b].[\/p][p]The upper floor features a gallery-like atmosphere with paintings, carefully positioned lighting, and a cozy reading area surrounded by bookshelves.[\/p][p]We've also added [b]three new shelf types[\/b], a classic checkout area, and plenty of small environmental details to make the entire store feel like a real place.[\/p][p][\/p][h2]\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Find 5 Hidden Arcade Tokens![\/h2][p]We've also hidden [b]5 Arcade Tokens[\/b] around the Gift Store![\/p][p]Explore the map, look carefully around your surroundings, and see if you can find all five. These tokens can be used to unlock perks, so keep your eyes open while tidying up![\/p][p][\/p][h2]\ud83c\udfec A New Step in Your Progression[\/h2][p]The Gift Store sits [b]between the Toy Store and Electronics Store[\/b] in the map progression, both in terms of difficulty and atmosphere.[\/p][p]We wanted to create a smoother transition from the cozy, colorful environments of the earlier maps to the more modern setting of the Electronics Store.[\/p][p]With its unique architecture, different product categories, and carefully designed layout, we believe the Gift Store fits perfectly into that progression.[\/p][h2]\ud83d\udce6 Map Details[\/h2][list][*][p][b]324 shelves[\/b][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]4,696 items to organize[\/b][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]350+ brand-new unique products[\/b][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]3 new shelf types[\/b][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]5 hidden Arcade Tokens[\/b][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Two-story layout with a balcony[\/b][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Dedicated Gift, Halloween, Christmas, and Book sections[\/b][\/p][\/*][\/list][p]One important detail: [b]No product types are duplicated across shelf slots![\/b] Each shelf slot has its own unique product type, making organizing the store a little more interesting.[\/p][p][\/p][h2]\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f What's Next? The Level Editor![\/h2][p]With the Gift Store complete, [b]all five of our originally planned official maps are now in place![\/b][\/p][p]That doesn't necessarily mean it's the last store we'll ever create, though! We'd be more than happy to keep expanding the game with new and unique stores if that's something our community would love to see. Additional maps could potentially come as optional DLCs in the future, and we'd love to hear what kinds of stores you'd be interested in![\/p][p]For now, our next major focus is the [b]Level Editor[\/b], where you'll be able to create your own stores using the huge variety of products and decorations we've added throughout the game.[\/p][p]As mentioned earlier, closed testing is already underway, and we're hoping to make the public playtest available before our current discount ends.[\/p][p]The feedback we've received so far has been incredibly helpful, and we're using it to refine the editor before opening it up to everyone. We want to make sure that building and sharing your own stores feels as smooth and enjoyable as possible.[\/p][p]We're incredibly excited to see what kinds of stores you'll create![\/p][p]In the meantime, we hope you enjoy exploring and tidying up the Gift Store. And if you're new to the game, don't forget to take advantage of [b]our biggest discount yet![\/b][\/p][p]As always, thank you for your continued support and feedback. \u2764\ufe0f[\/p][p][b]Happy tidying![\/b][\/p][p][i]Yolo Games Studio[\/i][\/p]","commentcount":20,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_871423085_1793380418_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"570427373261182875","event_gid":"702157662356244406","voteupcount":155,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"570427373261182875","rtime32_last_modified":1793411643,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793380419,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":26328794,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793365870,"votes_up":155,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585057095914903393","gidfeature2":"570427373261182875"},{"gid":"676260695908549424","clan_steamid":"103582791475771053","event_name":"Level Editor Sneak Peek \u2014 Closed Playtest Coming Soon!","event_type":28,"appid":5027520,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792167480,"rtime32_end_time":1792170300,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Create your own stores, share them on Steam Workshop, and play custom tidy-up maps with friends.\",null,\"Cr\u00e9ez vos propres magasins, partagez vos cartes sur le Workshop Steam et jouez avec vos amis !\",null,null,null,\"\u6253\u9020\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u5546\u5e97\uff0c\u901a\u8fc7 Steam \u521b\u610f\u5de5\u574a\u5206\u4eab\u5730\u56fe\uff0c\u8fd8\u80fd\u548c\u597d\u53cb\u4e00\u8d77\u6e38\u73a9\uff01\",null,null,null,\"\u81ea\u5206\u3060\u3051\u306e\u304a\u5e97\u3092\u4f5c\u308a\u3001Steam\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30d7\u3067\u5171\u6709\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30d5\u30ec\u30f3\u30c9\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u904a\u307c\u3046\uff01\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Kendi ma\u011fazan\u0131 tasarla, haritalar\u0131n\u0131 Steam At\u00f6lyesi'nde payla\u015f ve arkada\u015flar\u0131nla birlikte oyna!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"We\u2019re getting close to our first Level Editor playtest! Here\u2019s a first look at how you\u2019ll build, customize, and create your own playable maps.\",null,\"Le premier playtest ferm\u00e9 de notre \u00e9diteur de cartes approche ! D\u00e9couvrez en quatre GIF comment cr\u00e9er, personnaliser et pr\u00e9parer vos propres cartes jouables.\",null,null,null,\"\u5730\u56fe\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u5373\u5c06\u5f00\u542f\u9996\u6b21\u5c01\u95ed\u6d4b\u8bd5\uff01\u901a\u8fc7\u56db\u6bb5\u7b80\u77ed\u7684 GIF \u52a8\u56fe\uff0c\u62a2\u5148\u4e86\u89e3\u5982\u4f55\u5efa\u9020\u3001\u88c5\u9970\u5e76\u8bbe\u8ba1\u5c5e\u4e8e\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u53ef\u73a9\u5730\u56fe\u3002\",null,null,null,\"\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u30a8\u30c7\u30a3\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u521d\u56de\u30af\u30ed\u30fc\u30ba\u30c9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u9593\u8fd1\u306b\uff014\u3064\u306eGIF\u3067\u3001\u30aa\u30ea\u30b8\u30ca\u30eb\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u4f5c\u6210\u304b\u3089\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30de\u30a4\u30ba\u307e\u3067\u306e\u6d41\u308c\u3092\u3054\u7d39\u4ecb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Harita Edit\u00f6r\u00fcm\u00fcz\u00fcn ilk kapal\u0131 testine \u00e7ok az kald\u0131! Kendi haritalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 nas\u0131l olu\u015fturup \u00f6zelle\u015ftirebilece\u011finize d\u00f6rt k\u0131sa GIF ile g\u00f6z at\u0131n.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"c7e76dd98687ca22056e154afcaa34e7927b0e57.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"7d7b5f966058f21e02f2c43f91607cee23ed433b.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"676260695908549425","clanid":"46249645","posterid":"0","headline":"Level Editor Sneak Peek \u2014 Closed Playtest Coming Soon!","posttime":1792167521,"updatetime":1792167521,"body":"[h1]A First Look at Our Upcoming Level Editor![\/h1][p]Hey everyone![\/p][p]It\u2019s been a little while since our last update, and during that time we\u2019ve been working on something we\u2019re incredibly excited about: [b]the Level Editor for Megastore: Tidy Up Together![\/b][\/p][p]Today, we wanted to give you a closer look at what this feature is all about, what it will let you do, and how close we are to getting it into your hands.[\/p][p]For those who haven\u2019t heard about it yet, the Level Editor will let you [b]create your own fully playable tidy-up maps[\/b] using the game\u2019s shelves, products, structures, and decorations.[\/p][p]You\u2019ll be able to build your own stores, shape their layout, customize their appearance, and turn them into maps that you can [b]play with friends in co-op[\/b] and [b]share with the world through Steam Workshop[\/b].[\/p][p]That means this feature has the potential to bring [b]virtually endless replayability[\/b] to the game through community-created content.[\/p][p]We\u2019re still polishing the system, so what you\u2019ll see below is [b]not the final version yet[\/b], but we wanted to give you a sneak peek of the overall workflow and show how quickly you can start building something fun with the editor.[\/p][p]In the example below, we create a small enclosed area and turn it into a compact [b]toy section[\/b] in just a short time.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h1]A Quick Look at the Workflow[\/h1][h2]Step 1 - Structures[\/h2][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/ecf7bdb6d7bb9669a3b2e0985ca9b008448cbbee.gif\"][\/img][\/p][p]This is where the overall space starts to take shape.[\/p][p]Using the [b]Structures[\/b] tools, you can place walls and doors to define rooms and create different store sections. This allows you to control the layout of the map and divide areas however you want.[\/p][p]We\u2019re preparing a variety of structural pieces, including different kinds of walls and doors, so you can build spaces that feel open, compact, or more segmented depending on your design.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h2]Step 2 - Place & Customize[\/h2][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/2924c1f462279ecd63ac2302a1e660331d64329e.gif\"][\/img][\/p][p]Once the basic structure is in place, you can start giving the area its own identity.[\/p][p]In this step, you can [b]paint walls and floors[\/b], place [b]decorations[\/b], and begin adding [b]shelves[\/b] to shape the space into an actual playable store area. This is where the environment starts feeling alive and takes on its own style.[\/p][p]Our goal is to make customization flexible and easy to use, so you can quickly turn a simple empty area into something that looks and feels like a real store section.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h2]Step 3 - Signage and Assignment[\/h2][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/f0e2b20b6919b49a5d68f39585f9b3f6b06b1626.gif\"][\/img][\/p][p]After setting up the space, it\u2019s time to give it structure in terms of gameplay.[\/p][p]In this step, you can place [b]signage[\/b] and assign shelves to categories. This helps define what each shelf is meant for and gives the area a clear organizational purpose.[\/p][p]This part is especially important because it connects the visual side of the editor with the actual tidy-up gameplay flow, allowing your custom store sections to function the way you intend.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h2]Step 4 - Spawn Items[\/h2][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46249645\/c73efcfe6dab9206a4550ce21ce3c3ed5437e605.gif\"][\/img][\/p][p]And finally, the last step is bringing the map to life with products.[\/p][p]Here, you choose where items will spawn and populate the map with the products that players will organize. If you want to fine-tune the setup, you can also interact with the products directly and place them more manually, almost like playing the game itself.[\/p][p]This helps you shape the exact kind of tidy-up experience you want your custom map to offer. After this step, your map will be ready to share with one click to the entire world![\/p][hr][\/hr][h1]Designed to Be Accessible[\/h1][p]One of our biggest goals with the Level Editor is to make it feel approachable.[\/p][p]We don\u2019t want this to feel like a complicated external modding tool. Instead, we\u2019re designing it as an [b]in-game creation mode[\/b] that feels natural to use, something that lets you build and experiment in a way that\u2019s intuitive, playful, and satisfying.[\/p][p]In other words, we want making maps to feel like part of the game itself.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h1]Share Your Maps with the World[\/h1][p]Of course, creating maps is only one part of the excitement.[\/p][p]You\u2019ll also be able to [b]share your creations through Steam Workshop[\/b], allowing other players to download and enjoy them. And because these maps are built for the game itself, you\u2019ll be able to jump into them [b]with your friends in co-op[\/b] just like you would with our official content.[\/p][p]We\u2019re really excited about what this could mean for the future of the game. Instead of only replaying the same official levels, you\u2019ll be able to explore maps created by the community, from small cozy stores to much larger and more complex spaces.[\/p][p]We expect a lot of variety here, and that\u2019s exactly what makes this feature so exciting.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h1]Closed Playtest Coming Soon[\/h1][p]We\u2019re currently preparing the Level Editor for its [b]first closed playtest[\/b], which we\u2019re aiming to start [b]within the next few days[\/b].[\/p][p]This playtest will use a [b]private Steam Workshop setup[\/b], and access will be limited to participants during the testing period.[\/p][p]If you\u2019d like to join and help us shape this feature, [b]please join our Discord[\/b], we\u2019ll share more details there.[\/p][p]During the playtest, we\u2019ll be focusing on:[\/p][list][*][p]improving the overall workflow,[\/p][\/*][*][p]polishing the user experience,[\/p][\/*][*][p]fixing bugs,[\/p][\/*][*][p]and collecting feedback before release.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]Our goal is to [b]release the Level Editor shortly after the playtest[\/b], once we\u2019ve had time to act on the feedback and make the feature more solid.[\/p][p]We will bring this update to the game [b]before our fifth official map[\/b].[\/p][p]And after that fifth map arrives, its shelves and products will also become available in the editor, giving you even more tools to build with.[\/p][hr][\/hr][h1]A Big Step for the Future of the Game[\/h1][p]From the beginning, we wanted Megastore: Tidy Up Together to be more than a game you simply finish and move on from.[\/p][p]We wanted it to be something that could grow with its community \u2014 a game that could keep offering fresh experiences through creativity, sharing, and replayability.[\/p][p]That\u2019s why we\u2019ve been designing our systems with this kind of feature in mind from the start.[\/p][p]We\u2019re incredibly excited that it\u2019s finally getting close, and we can\u2019t wait to show you more very soon.[\/p][p]Thank you so much for your support, patience, and enthusiasm.[\/p][p][b]A huge new chapter for Megastore: Tidy Up Together is on the way![\/b][\/p]","commentcount":17,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1607812438_1792168591_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"573803804385101104","event_gid":"676260695908549424","voteupcount":233,"votedowncount":2,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"573803804385101104","rtime32_last_modified":1793407116,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792168592,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792163866,"votes_up":233,"votes_down":2,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585057095914903393","gidfeature2":"573803804385101104"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["702157662356244407","676260695908549425"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1793378760,"event_gid":"702157662356244406","announcement_gid":"702157662356244407","clan_account_id":46249645}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Get the Stores Ready for Opening</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Megastore: Tidy Up Together is a cozy organization game about transforming messy stores into clean, carefully arranged shopping spaces, either solo or together in online co-op.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Products are scattered throughout each store, and every item belongs in a specific department, category, and shelf. Follow the signs, identify where each product belongs, group matching items together, and place everything in its correct location before the store opens.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Work together, divide the store between your team, develop an organization strategy, and gradually bring order to thousands of products.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Four Stores Available</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The game currently features four fully playable stores of increasing scale, each offering a different organization challenge, product selection, and atmosphere.</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Toy Store:</strong> Begin your journey in a smaller and cozier single-story store filled with colorful toys and summer essentials. Sort 3,555 items and place them across 297 shelves while learning how to identify, group, and organize each product.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Electronics Store:</strong> Organize an enormous electronics retailer packed with an entirely new selection of products. Sort 6,203 items across 477 shelves, ranging from gaming PCs, consoles, games, monitors, mice, keyboards, phones, laptops, and accessories to TVs, washing machines, refrigerators, dishwashers, vacuum cleaners, coffee machines, and other home appliances.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Supermarket:</strong> Tidy up a bustling supermarket packed with fresh favorites and everyday essentials. Organize 7,934 products across 487 shelves and prepare every aisle and fresh-food counter for opening.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Megastore:</strong> Take on the challenge of a massive two-story megastore containing 13,380 items across nine departments and 978 shelves. Organize the entire building and restore order across its huge variety of departments. Playable solo, but co-op is recommended.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play through all four stores solo or cooperatively, choose the difficulty that suits you, split responsibilities between players, focus on different departments, or work together shelf by shelf.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Sort, Group, and Shelve</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Organizing each store requires more than simply picking products up from the floor.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Pay attention to department signs, recognize product categories, group similar items together, and determine which shelf is appropriate for each product. As the empty shelves begin to fill and the store gradually takes shape, every correctly placed item brings you one step closer to opening.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >With more than <strong>1,350 unique products</strong> and 65<strong> different shelf types</strong>, the store contains a huge variety of items to identify and organize.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Develop Your Own Strategy</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Progress through the skill tree and unlock abilities that increase the pace of the cleanup.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Improve your movement and organization capabilities, choose upgrades that suit your preferred playstyle, and decide how your team will approach each store. The skills you prioritize can shape your strategy and help you complete increasingly large sections of the store more efficiently.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whether you focus on speed, carrying capacity, or other useful improvements, each upgrade helps you work through the store faster.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >More Stores Coming</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >One additional store is already in active development and is planned for a future free update, expanding the game from four stores to five.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Custom Levels Coming in a Major Update</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Custom level creation and sharing are also in active development and planned as one of the game's major updates.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Players will be able to design their own organization challenges, share them with the community, and play custom levels together in co-op. Development is already underway, and more details will be shared as the update gets closer to release.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					AI tools were used to assist with some of the game’s translations and in the creation of two in-game textures. These textures were subsequently edited, refined, and carefully reviewed by a human before being included in the final game.<br />
<br />
We strictly rely on human creativity and craftsmanship throughout the game’s development.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
